  <result aggregation-status="0" type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output A.1. Enhanced decent work statistics using innovative sources and statistical standards</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brunei Darussalam has revised its 2022 Labour Force Survey questionnaire to fully implement the 19th International Labour Conference of Statisticians (ICLS) work statistics and to measure the 20th ICLS Resolution I on work relationships, International Classification of Status in Employment (ICSE-18).  The microdata and report was published in 2023. The ILO provided technical support in revising the LFS questionnaire, as well as training the statistical office on the new concepts introduced by the 20th ICLS (such as on dependent contractors).</narrative>
   </description>
